{"unit_id":"maxwell-feng__dsh-tinyfish-search#card-zh","repo":"maxwell-feng/dsh-tinyfish-search","commit":"c1e85c3d9a931bf5e8a538b2222f477cfa842711","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tinyfish-search 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的网页搜索插件，通过 ctx.web 注册 tinyfish 提供方，并在 bundle 中把 web_search 路由到 TinyFish Search API。它把查询、可选地区和语言作为请求参数，接收结果后整理为链接、标题、摘要和日期，并按请求上限去重返回。配置支持实时生效，凭据可从 DSH 凭据服务、启动环境或 TINYFISH_API_KEY 读取。适合希望将 Harness 内置网页搜索接入 TinyFish 的用户；需要 TinyFish API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:37-45","cordis.patch.yml:33-54","src/provider.ts:80-99","src/provider.ts:198-214","src/options.ts:25-41"]}
